{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然距离结业式已经没几天了，\\n也得亏现在是考试刚结束，只剩等着放寒假的这段空闲时期——", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "虽然距离结业式已经没几天了，也得亏现在是考试刚结束，只剩等着放寒假的这段空闲时期——", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学，这是从社团成员那里拿过来的哟～」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0046", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的吗？我记得你应该是拉拉队那边的吧」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3188", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然还是想去为男子棒球社和足球社那边的\\n　比赛去加油助威啊，诶嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "「果然还是想去为男子棒球社和足球社那边的　比赛去加油助威啊，诶嘿嘿……」", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0047", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "各务台校男生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生～这捆纸\\n　是要送到打印室那边吗？」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "「瓜生～这捆纸　是要送到打印室那边吗？」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "db0026", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……不好意思啊，帮大忙了！\\n　我把刚拿到的这些订好之后就去你那边帮忙！」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「啊……不好意思啊，帮大忙了！　我把刚拿到的这些订好之后就去你那边帮忙！」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，高一那边也有想帮忙的学生」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0642", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和想象中一样，已经保送了的学生，\\n　果然都蛮闲的～」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "「和想象中一样，已经保送了的学生，　果然都蛮闲的～」", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0305", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我回来啦。\\n　哼哼哼哼，看好了噢，这签名的量……真不愧是我」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "「我回来啦。　哼哼哼哼，看好了噢，这签名的量……真不愧是我」", "plain_idx": 228, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "签名的收集比想象中的还要更加顺利。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我和爱理已经是忙得不可开交了，\\n但这对我们而言却也是痛并快乐着。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "虽然我和爱理已经是忙得不可开交了，但这对我们而言却也是痛并快乐着。", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说真的，从男女不同班的那些人手里，\\n　我本来以为收集不来多少署名……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「说真的，从男女不同班的那些人手里，　我本来以为收集不来多少署名……」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3189", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这不正好是昨天班里同学说的，\\n　全校可能都认为“光他们尝到甜头了”嘛？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "「这不正好是昨天班里同学说的，　全校可能都认为“光他们尝到甜头了”嘛？」", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，啊……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3190", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我……我们俩，\\n　在别人面前有那么过分吗……？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "「我……我们俩，　在别人面前有那么过分吗……？」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3191", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是啦不是啦，不是这样的，\\n　我的意思是T班男女生能在一块真好啊什么的」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「不是啦不是啦，不是这样的，　我的意思是T班男女生能在一块真好啊什么的」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也……也是哦，\\n　我们俩也没太在别人面前公开秀恩爱来着」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "「也……也是哦，　我们俩也没太在别人面前公开秀恩爱来着」", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3192", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，可别吓唬我了……\\n　我还以为是亲的时候被人给瞅见了呢……」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "「真是的，可别吓唬我了……　我还以为是亲的时候被人给瞅见了呢……」", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3193", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "各务台校女生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那啥那啥，好像濑名同学那一对儿，\\n　搁学校里面直接亲上了哦～」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": "「那啥那啥，好像濑名同学那一对儿，　搁学校里面直接亲上了哦～」", "plain_idx": 253, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sb0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！！」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3194", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别、别说了啊！！\\n　求你了别再往下说了～！」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「别、别说了啊！！　求你了别再往下说了～！」", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3195", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "各务台校男生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生啊……你女朋友还确实是破绽百出呢～」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "「瓜生啊……你女朋友还确实是破绽百出呢～」", "plain_idx": 261, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "da0038", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那啥，真的不好意思，就放过我们俩吧」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "各务台校女生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「俩人都满脸通红～」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sb0042", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新……新吾你这个笨蛋！」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3196", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶、我？！」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为新吾把话题导向了奇怪的方向……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3197", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，有种像是第二回合要开打了的感觉」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……不、不是这样的，大家听我说，不是这样的！！」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3198", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "各务台校女生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「多谢款待」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sb0043", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3199", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这事儿先暂且不论，事已至此，\\n我和爱理也没办法。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "这事儿先暂且不论，事已至此，我和爱理也没办法。", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诸位走好～\\n　诸位走好～～但在这之前呢～」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「诸位走好～　诸位走好～～但在这之前呢～」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还请在这签下您的名字！」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3200", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是为了表达对奋战在正式并校工作第一线的校长的支持，才开展的署名活动」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "「这是为了表达对奋战在正式并校工作第一线的校长的支持，才开展的署名活动」", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们俩与在校门口送行的安洁一同，\\n号召着过往的学生进行署名。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "我们俩与在校门口送行的安洁一同，号召着过往的学生进行署名。", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在兰华校长正在校外出差。\\n　所以现在就是最好时机，诶嘿嘿嘿嘿」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「现在兰华校长正在校外出差。　所以现在就是最好时机，诶嘿嘿嘿嘿」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢你，安洁。能让引人注目的安洁\\n　带头呼吁，真的帮了我们大忙了」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「谢谢你，安洁。能让引人注目的安洁　带头呼吁，真的帮了我们大忙了」", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3201", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿，不愧是安洁我呢」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且新吾同学，爱理同学，\\n　这样子试着站在校门这，\\n　有没有明白了些什么呢？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "「而且新吾同学，爱理同学，　这样子试着站在校门这，　有没有明白了些什么呢？」", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶……怎么说呢」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁觉得，\\n　各位学生比起10月初那会儿，\\n　都变得俊男靓女了起来」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「安洁觉得，　各位学生比起10月初那会儿，　都变得俊男靓女了起来」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶……啊……嗯，这么说的话也确实……」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3202", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为成天都被各务台的男生们看着，\\n所以结女校的女生们也从不疏忽大意。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "因为成天都被各务台的男生们看着，所以结女校的女生们也从不疏忽大意。", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可能因为面对的都是结女校的大小姐们——\\n各务台的学生们也都一刻都没有松懈。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "可能因为面对的都是结女校的大小姐们——各务台的学生们也都一刻都没有松懈。", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想到了之前校长在全校大会上面说的那些话了。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……果然，女貌还需郎才搭，郎才亦需女貌配」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈哈，确实是这样呢～爱理同学♪\\n　是真的变得更漂亮了～」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "「啊哈哈哈，确实是这样呢～爱理同学♪　是真的变得更漂亮了～」", "plain_idx": 314, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等……别、别这样说啦……」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3203", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「与其这样说，倒不如说爱理从以前开始就很可爱了」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇，新吾同学秀恩爱的水平真的是相当厉害！！」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～～……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3204", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「连爱理同学也都变得哑口无言了」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0604", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至于“不论何时都很纯真无邪，惹人怜爱”这种话，\\n最后还是选择不说出口。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "至于“不论何时都很纯真无邪，惹人怜爱”这种话，最后还是选择不说出口。", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不论如何，收集签名一事虽说有在顺利进行，但是——", "text_idx": 327, "plain": "不论如何，收集签名一事虽说有在顺利进行，但是——", "plain_idx": 327, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么说呢……\\n　光这些的话会不会不够啊……？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「怎么说呢……　光这些的话会不会不够啊……？」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两人从校门回来，\\n正在食堂一边休息着，一边喝点东西。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": "两人从校门回来，正在食堂一边休息着，一边喝点东西。", "plain_idx": 331, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然冒出了这样的想法。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也有同感」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3205", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理一边深吸一口气，一边面露难色。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，仅仅一介学生在这之上又做不了什么了……\\n　即使是去募集资金，也多少有点那啥了」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "「不过，仅仅一介学生在这之上又做不了什么了……　即使是去募集资金，也多少有点那啥了」", "plain_idx": 337, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3206", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是啦，不是这个意思，我是说是对校长啦」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯？」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3207", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有了这么多的署名，肯定能助一臂之力，\\n　但是该怎么说呢……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": "「有了这么多的署名，肯定能助一臂之力，　但是该怎么说呢……」", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一边说着，一边整顿着思绪。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实，这么多署名能助我们一臂之力，\\n但这再怎么样，也不过是数字面上的……", "text_idx": 345, "plain": "确实，这么多署名能助我们一臂之力，但这再怎么样，也不过是数字面上的……", "plain_idx": 346, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你看，校长在全校大会上总是那种，\\n　看着全校学生的脸讲话的人的感觉对吧？」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": "「你看，校长在全校大会上总是那种，　看着全校学生的脸讲话的人的感觉对吧？」", "plain_idx": 348, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊！」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3208", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "言而未尽却已了然于胸，\\n爱理心领神会，目光迥然。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": "言而未尽却已了然于胸，爱理心领神会，目光迥然。", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，这份“言而未尽却已了然于胸的事情”\\n也不可思议地惹得我俩嗤嗤偷笑。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "然后，这份“言而未尽却已了然于胸的事情”也不可思议地惹得我俩嗤嗤偷笑。", "plain_idx": 354, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对吧？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……是啊，确实也想好好干上一番呢」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3210", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘛，这也是因为有了爱理所想的基本方针，\\n　才能将这种好想法付诸于募集署名，从而为校长打一剂强心针呢」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "「嘛，这也是因为有了爱理所想的基本方针，　才能将这种好想法付诸于募集署名，从而为校长打一剂强心针呢」", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 52, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……咱俩还挺心有灵犀的」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3211", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总感觉，等注意到的时候，咱俩就已经是这样了」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两人又一次相视而笑。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同心相思，付诸于手。\\n十指相扣，心手相牵。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": "同心相思，付诸于手。十指相扣，心手相牵。", "plain_idx": 365, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是我。新吾是新吾……」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3212", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一个是女生，一个是男生」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……但是」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3213", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不同形状的手与手，也能相握在一起。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「合在一起就是“我们”……对吧」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3214", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的温度与爱理的温度，\\n最终相互传递，合二为一。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": "我的温度与爱理的温度，最终相互传递，合二为一。", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "成为了虽不是任何一人的温度，但又是两人共有的温度。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯！\\n　出发吧，新吾。还有很多人留在学校呢！」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": "「……嗯！　出发吧，新吾。还有很多人留在学校呢！」", "plain_idx": 378, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3215", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好嘞」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
